OL,3,ABrazil's President Lula hails oil
OL,4,Adiscovery near Amazon river
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,7,FSilva has hailed the discovery of oil
OL,8,Fnear the mouth of the Amazon river.
OL,10,FSpeaking after the find was announced
OL,11,Fby Brazil's state-run oil company
OL,12,FPetrobras, he said it could be "a
OL,13,Fpassport to the country's future".
OL,15,FHis decision to allow exploratory
OL,16,Fdrilling in the area known as the
OL,17,FBrazilian Equatorial Margin was heavily
OL,18,Fcriticised by environmentalists, who
OL,19,Fraised concerns that any potential oil
OL,20,Fspills could devastate its ecosystem.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
